  greetings:
  - "Finally, for your last guideline, this is anything too good to be true. You
    probably know the adage, \u201Cif it\u2019s too good to be true, it probably
    is\u201C and said adage certainly applies here. Major discounts on products/services,
    free stuff that you didn\u2019t order, anything of the sort that is following
    that adage, will try to trick you. Fortunately, these are pretty easy to spot."
